---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="首页"
  description="率领 300 个智能体，解决人类最大的问题。OMAR 是一个用于创建强大智能体组织的 TUI 工具。"
  lang="zh-CN"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          一人成团，<br />
          指挥 <span class="hero-accent">300 个智能体。</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">
          <code>omar</code> 是一个用于创建强大智能体组织的 TUI 工具。 在一个终端内指挥深层并行
          AI 智能体层级。
        </p>
        <div class="hero-install">
          <p class="hero-install-label">一键安装：</p>
          <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> curl -fsSL https://omarmy.ai/install.sh | sh</code></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/zh/docs/" class="btn btn-primary">快速开始</a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/lsk567/omar"
            class="btn btn-outline"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener">GitHub 仓库</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-image">
        <img src="/img/thermopylae.png" alt="温泉关 - 指挥你的智能体军团" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section class="features">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">核心特性</h2>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">&#9632;</div>
          <h3>专业 TUI 仪表盘</h3>
          <p>基于 ratatui 构建的精美终端界面，在一个地方监控所有智能体。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">&#9650;</div>
          <h3>深层智能体层级</h3>
          <p>创建并行的智能体组织，就像一家公司。用方向键在层级间导航。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">&#9654;</div>
          <h3>对话任意智能体</h3>
          <p>附加到任意层级的任意智能体。你始终掌控对话。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">&#9733;</div>
          <h3>Slack 集成</h3>
          <p>将智能体连接到 Slack 频道，打通人类与 AI 的工作流。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">&#9788;</div>
          <h3>桌面操控</h3>
          <p>智能体可以看到并控制你的 Linux 桌面。调试 GUI，与应用交互。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">&#9881;</div>
          <h3>高度可定制</h3>
          <p>基于 tmux 构建。支持所有 tmux 命令和快捷键，提供最大灵活性。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quick Start -->
  <section class="quickstart">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">快速开始</h2>
      <div class="install-methods">
        <div class="install-tabs">
          <button class="install-tab active" data-tab="oneliner">一键安装</button>
          <button class="install-tab" data-tab="brew">Homebrew</button>
          <button class="install-tab" data-tab="source">从源码编译</button>
        </div>
        <div class="install-panel active" id="panel-oneliner">
          <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> curl -fsSL https://omarmy.ai/install.sh | sh</code></pre>
          <p class="install-note">支持 macOS 和 Linux，默认安装到 <code>/usr/local/bin</code>。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="install-panel" id="panel-brew">
          <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> brew install lsk567/omar/omar</code></pre>
          <p class="install-note">自动安装 tmux 依赖。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="install-panel" id="panel-source">
          <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> git clone https://github.com/lsk567/omar.git
<span class="prompt">$</span> cd omar && make install</code></pre>
          <p class="install-note">需要 Rust 1.70+ 和 GNU Make。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>前置条件</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>tmux 3.0+</li>
              <li>
                <a
                  href="https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/agents-and-tools/claude-code/overview"
                  >Claude Code</a
                > 或 <a href="https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode">Opencode</a
                >
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>启动</h3>
            <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> omar</code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>给执行助理下达任务</h3>
            <p>将提示词粘贴到执行助理窗口，观察智能体自动创建。</p>
            <pre><code>Load and run &lt;omar-root&gt;/prompts/tests/project-factory.md</code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Agent Backends -->
  <section class="backends">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">支持的智能体后端</h2>
      <div class="backends-table">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>后端</th>
              <th>启动方式</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td
                ><a
                  href="https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/agents-and-tools/claude-code/overview"
                  >Claude Code</a
                ></td
              >
              <td><code>omar</code>（默认）</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td
                ><a href="https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode">Opencode</a
                ></td
              >
              <td><code>omar --agent opencode</code></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -50%;
    left: -50%;
    width: 200%;
    height: 200%;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse at 30% 20%,
      rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.08) 0%,
      transparent 50%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .hero-accent {
    color: var(--crimson);
    text-shadow: 0 0 40px var(--crimson-glow);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    max-width: 700px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-subtitle code {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero-install {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-install-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-install pre {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .prompt {
    color: var(--accent);
    user-select: none;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .hero-image {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .hero-image img {
    max-width: 100%;
    width: 600px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    opacity: 0.9;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  /* Features */
  .features {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.75rem;
    transition:
      border-color 0.2s,
      transform 0.2s;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--crimson);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Quick Start */
  .quickstart {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .install-methods {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  .install-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .install-tab {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .install-tab:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .install-tab.active {
    color: var(--crimson);
    border-bottom-color: var(--crimson);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .install-panel {
    display: none;
  }

  .install-panel.active {
    display: block;
  }

  .install-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .install-note code {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .steps {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .step-num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--crimson);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--crimson-glow);
  }

  .step-content {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .step-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .step-content ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .step-content li {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.15rem 0;
  }

  .step-content li::before {
    content: "- ";
    color: var(--crimson);
  }

  .step-content pre {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .step-content p {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  /* Backends */
  .backends {
    padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .backends-table {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .backends-table table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
  }

  .backends-table th,
  .backends-table td {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .backends-table th {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .hero-image {
      order: -1;
    }

    .hero-image img {
      max-width: 90%;
      width: 400px;
    }

    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .step {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.install-tab').forEach(tab => {
    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
      document.querySelectorAll('.install-tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
      document.querySelectorAll('.install-panel').forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));
      tab.classList.add('active');
      document.getElementById(`panel-${tab.dataset.tab}`)?.classList.add('active');
    });
  });
</script>
